No. 8.18 (Guo Shuchun's reading of Liu Hui's 124)
% Liu Hui's new method (方程新術) on Problem 18, as Guo Shuchun works it: 九章筭術譯注 (revised, 2020),
% ch. 8, notes 41-62, figure 8-8 (not in the transcription read). Read by a second model, OpenAI Codex,
% which marked what it read and what it reconstructed; see docs/guo-77.md, section 3. The operations
% are its expansion of the procedure, cross-checked against Guo's notes; how many times each column is
% taken is worked out from the figures, not read from Guo's figure. The figures asserted are those the
% notes or the text state. Guo gives no tally for the 124 (n. 82 states the total only).
% Liu Hui's 124 covers the whole method; this page is the part that finds the rates (to n. 62). The
% last part, the columns set afresh, is the page liu-hui-18-rates.
"方程新術曰以正負術入之令左右相減先去下實又轉去物位求其一行二物正負相借者易其相當之率"
Things 麻 麥 菽 荅 黍 實
Set right 9 7 3 2 5 140
Set 2nd   7 6 4 5 3 128
Set 3rd   3 5 7 6 4 116
Set 4th   2 5 3 9 4 112
Set left  1 3 2 8 5  95
% n. 42: the 4th from the 3rd
Take 4th from 3rd.                           "以新術爲此先以第四行減第三行"
% the 3rd is now 1 0 4 -3 0 4
% n. 43: the 實s of the right, the 2nd and the 4th removed by the 3rd
Take 3rd from right 35 times.                "次以第三行去右行"
Take 3rd from 2nd 32 times.                  "及第二行"
Take 3rd from 4th 28 times.                  "第四行下位"
% n. 44: the text prints 右行, whose 實 is already gone; read as 左行, as Guo works it
Take 3rd from left 23 times.                 "又以減右行下位不足減乃止"
% n. 45
Take left from 3rd.                          "次以左行減第三行下位"
% n. 46
Take 3rd from left 3 times.                  "次以第三行去左行下位"
% Every operation so far is fixed by the text: 減 once, 去 until the 實 is gone, 不足減乃止 as far
% as it goes. The board now holds the most rods it ever holds on this path, 124 (`jiuzhang rods`),
% and the text drops the 3rd column at once.
Drop 3rd.                                    "訖廢去第三行"
% n. 47
Take 4th from left 5 times.
Take 4th from right.
% n. 48
Take right from 2nd 3 times.
Take right from 4th 4 times.
% n. 49
Take 2nd from 4th.
Add 2nd to left.
% n. 50
Take 4th from left 3 times.
% n. 51: added, then halved twice
Add left to 2nd.
Halve 2nd.                                   "餘可再半"
Halve 2nd.
% n. 52
Add 4th to left 17 times.
Take 4th from 2nd 2 times.
% n. 53
Add 2nd to left 11 times.
Gives left 0 0 -310 186 0 0
Divide left by 62.                           "餘約之"
Gives left 0 0 -5 3 0 0 | Gives left 0 0 5 -3 0 0   "上得五下得三是菽五當荅三"
% n. 54
Take left from 2nd 19 times.
Add left to 4th 8 times.
Take left from right 5 times.
% n. 55
Take right from 2nd 2 times.
% n. 56
Take 2nd from right 2 times.
% n. 57
Take left from right 3 times.
Gives right 0 0 0 -6 5 0 | Gives right 0 0 0 6 -5 0   "餘上得六下得五是爲荅六當黍五"
% n. 58
Add left to right 2 times.
Gives right 0 0 -10 0 5 0
Divide right by 5.                           "餘約之"
Gives right 0 0 -2 0 1 0
% n. 59
Add right to 2nd 2 times.
% n. 60
Add 2nd to 4th.
Add 2nd to left.
% n. 61: added as written, the 2nd is 0 3 -4; Guo's note gives -3 4, the same rate (docs/guo-77.md)
Add left to 2nd 2 times.
Gives 2nd 0 3 -4 0 0 0 | Gives 2nd 0 -3 4 0 0 0   "餘上得三下得四是爲麥三當菽四"
% n. 62: with the 2nd as added, the 4th takes it by adding
Add 2nd to 4th.
Add 4th to 2nd 4 times.
Gives 2nd -4 7 0 0 0 0 | Gives 2nd 4 -7 0 0 0 0   "餘上得四下得七是爲麻四當麥七"
"是爲相當之率舉矣"
Count 124                                    "如此則凡用一百二十四算也"
